  },
  {
    "id": "3763cfb6f4686959",
    "text": "4th axis is not responsive",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "b8ee8d4feca15ecd",
    "text": "The 4th axis module needs to be plugged into the machine base to work.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "9f59e7c1f12c033c",
    "text": "Follow the below steps to solve a problematic 4th axis:",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "a5f6f6f6d7fe432e",
    "text": "Check all plugs and plug connectors.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "927cd094f9487115",
    "text": "Firstly, remove the machine bed by loosening the below screws.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "73dc2b9c23ea4b21",
    "text": "Clean the inside of the machine bed after removing the top.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "df4cb7937057b1de",
    "text": "Make sure all cables are connected securely.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "a881c3f4accf1dbf",
    "text": "Check side prongs to see if none are bent or damaged.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "0213be5a7878a42f",
    "text": "If the above does not resolve the problem, remove the back panel and check if the 4-axis cable is plugged into the controller securely.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "37bc81c77eacca3d",
    "text": "Next, switch the 4th axis plug with the ATC plug and do an ATC command and see if the 4th axis reacts.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "8fc469456a9e8ab5",
    "text": "If the 4th does react. The problem is either with the driver or the control board.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "24feb9cd76cdf9e8",
    "text": "To eliminate the control board: remove the controller cover and switch the drivers and see if the 4th axis reacts.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "9cf8ff8fa804d9eb",
    "text": "Remember to put the pink thermal silicone pad back when closing the lid.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "934d49d804e97efd",
    "text": "Contact support if the problem persists.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis"
  },
  {
    "id": "45c3f0e73994a043",
    "text": "Adjusting Rotational Z Offset",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "bba47a8c92f61aea",
    "text": "Resolving Incorrect Diameter Cutting on the 4th Axis Relief",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "253ee1156f12aeb7",
    "text": "If the 4th axis relief does not cut the part to the correct diameter, follow these steps to ensure the stock is properly secured and the",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "c64825bbad42cd68",
    "text": "is calibrated correctly.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "93487877b584966a",
    "text": "Step 1: Securing the Stock in the 4th Axis Chuck",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "9af42bbb0df940e7",
    "text": "Verify that the stock material is straight and cut square on both ends.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "195b0def59cda712",
    "text": "Find the center of the stock material:",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "d929220f05dd4443",
    "text": "Draw a cross on one end by connecting opposite corners (Figure 1).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "8774060d913ccf81",
    "text": "This marks the center point for proper alignment.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "13f38f3285fc1c1f",
    "text": "Insert the stock into the chuck:",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "fc0f3564efbe171a",
    "text": "Place the",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "90b61008a93af52e",
    "text": "non-marked",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "f235e7baf6bb3588",
    "text": "end into the chuck.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "0f64a813c45cc28d",
    "text": "Ensure it sits flush against the flat inside of the chuck jaws.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "f21fe4e69c095bfb",
    "text": "Secure the chuck jaws:",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  },
  {
    "id": "268d658db3e354bf",
    "text": "Tighten the jaws by hand by rotating the black ring",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/carvera/troubleshooting/4th-axis/Rotational_z_offset"
  }
]
